--- normal gameplay ---
bug walks around (visible for now)
audio cues when close
sneak mechanic to get close to bug

--- interaction mechanic ---
if bug does question mark, they are spooked and hear you but wont run yet
if you are too loud and close, the bug will run away
when bug has exclamation mark, they attack, entering capture game

--- capture game ---
bug walk around on screen but should attack cursour later
player circles the bug
player's capture resource reduces as they attempt to circle
getting hit reduces player capture resource
successfully circling the bug increases the bug's capture meter
win con: fill the bug's capture meter
lose con: your bug capture meter is empty
lose con 2: time limit and you didnt catch

--- post-capture ---
new capture?
- true: insectopedia menu -> but captured label appears on hud
- false: bug captured label appears on hud


